1️⃣ Install Required Tools

brew install k3d kubectl helm natscli minio
brew install argocd
brew install jq

Install Docker Desktop

2️⃣ Create cluster

k3d cluster create vision-cluster \
  --servers 1 \
  --agents 2 \
  --servers-memory 4g \
  --agents-memory 4g

Check:

kubectl get nodes

PHASE 3 — Install Core Namespaces
  kubectl create namespace serving
  kubectl create namespace data
  kubectl create namespace observability
  kubectl create namespace training
  kubectl create namespace gitops


🚀 PHASE 4 — Install ArgoCD (GitOps)
  kubectl apply -n gitops -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/argoproj/argo-cd/stable/manifests/install.yaml

Expose ArgoCD UI:

kubectl port-forward svc/argocd-server -n gitops 8081:443

Access:

https://localhost:8081

Get password:

user: admin
kubectl -n gitops get secret argocd-initial-admin-secret -o jsonpath="{.data.password}" | base64 -d

🚀 PHASE 5 — Install Data Layer
3️⃣ Install MinIO
helm repo add minio https://charts.min.io/

helm install minio minio/minio -n data \
  --set mode=standalone \
  --set rootUser=minio \
  --set rootPassword=minio123456

4️⃣ Install PostgreSQL
helm repo add bitnami https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami
helm install postgres bitnami/postgresql -n data


5️⃣ Install NATS JetStream
helm repo add nats https://nats-io.github.io/k8s/helm/charts/
helm install nats nats/nats -n data --set jetstream.enabled=true

🚀 PHASE 8 — Observability (LGTM on Mac)

Install Grafana stack via Helm:

helm repo add grafana https://grafana.github.io/helm-charts

Install:

Loki

Tempo

Mimir

Grafana

